From 2fa82e28a82d218bd630b0426516ee0f2ae046d3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 20:08:26 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Replace the deprecated serde_yaml with serde_norway

serde_yaml 0.9.34 is deprecated, its last release fails the dangerous_implicit_autorefs lint, and it
pulls in the unmaintained unsafe-libyaml (RUSTSEC-2024-0449). serde_norway is its maintained
drop-in fork, so the advisory exception it needed is removed.
---
 codex-rs/.cargo/audit.toml                    |  1 -
 codex-rs/Cargo.lock                           | 38 +++++++++----------
 codex-rs/Cargo.toml                           |  2 +-
 codex-rs/core-plugins/Cargo.toml              |  2 +-
 .../core-plugins/src/command_migration.rs     |  4 +-
 codex-rs/core-plugins/src/plugin_metrics.rs   |  2 +-
 codex-rs/deny.toml                            |  1 -
 codex-rs/external-agent-migration/Cargo.toml  |  2 +-
 .../external-agent-migration/src/subagents.rs |  4 +-
 codex-rs/skills/Cargo.toml                    |  2 +-
 codex-rs/skills/src/metadata.rs               |  4 +-
 codex-rs/skills/src/parser.rs                 |  8 ++--
 12 files changed, 34 insertions(+), 36 deletions(-)

